b></font><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>| </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uswords/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>스워드</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uthrowing/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>던지는 \n                무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> |</b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>완드</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Elite \nUniques</font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>: </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>아머</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020130223321/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></a><font color=\"olive\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Exceptional Unique Bow \n                             \n                            </b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>[익셉셔널 유니크 활]</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/unique/langerbriser.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"118\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:62/118\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Langer \nBriser</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Arbalest</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Two-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(40.5-45) To (85.6-114)</font> (63.05-79.5 Avg)<br>Required Level: \n32<br>Required Strength: 52<br>Required Dexterity: 61<br>Base Weapon Speed: \n[-10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+170-200% Enhanced Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10-30 To Maximum Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">33% \nChance Of Open Wounds</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 1-212 Lightning \nDamage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+30 To Life</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Knockback</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30-60% Better Chance Of \nGetting Magic Items</font>(varies)<br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>양손데미지 \n                            : <font color=\"#4850b8\">(40.5-45) To (85.6-114)</font> (63.05-79.5 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 \n                            : \n32<br>힘 요구치 : 52<br>덱스 요구치 : 61<br>무기긱본속도 : \n[-10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+170-200% 증가된데미지 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10-30 최대데미지 증가 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">33% \n상처회복저지 </font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">1-212 라이트닝 데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+30 라이프 </font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">뒤로밀침</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30-60% 매직아이템 얻을 확률증가</font>(varies)<br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n\n</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/pusspitter.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Pus \nSpitter</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Siege Crossbow</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Two-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(52.5-67.2) To (107.5-137.6)</font> (80-102.4 Avg)<br>Required \nLevel: 36<br>Required Strength: <font color=\"#4850b8\">32</font><br>Required \nDexterity: <font color=\"#4850b8\">28</font><br>Base Weapon Speed: [0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150-220% Enhanced Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150 Poison Damage Over 8 Seconds</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Requirements -60%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">9% Chance To Cast \nLevel 6 Poison Nova When Struck</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">4% Chance To Cast \nLevel 1 Lower Resist On Striking</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (5 Per \nCharacter Level) 5-495 To Attack Rating (Based On Character \nLevel)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% Increased Attack Speed</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Necromancer Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% \nTo Maximum Poison Resist</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Poison Resist \n+25%</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>양손데미지 \n                            : <font color=\"#4850b8\">(52.5-67.2) To (107.5-137.6)</font> (80-102.4 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 \n                            : 36<br>힘 요구치 : <font color=\"#4850b8\">32</font><br>덱스 요구치 : <font color=\"#4850b8\">28</font><br>무기기본속도 : [0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150-220% 증가된데미지 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">매 8초당 포이즌 데미지 +150</font><br></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#4850b8\">착용 요구치 -60%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">9% 기회로 레벨 6 포이즌 노바 시전</font></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#4850b8\">(반격시)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">4% 기회로 레벨 1 Lower Resist 시전</font></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#4850b8\">(공격시)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (캐릭터레벨 5마다 ) 5-495 </font></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#4850b8\">공격등급 (캐릭터레벨에 비례해서)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% 공격등급 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 네크로멘서 스킬</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% 최대 포이즌 저항력 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">포이즌 저항력 +25%</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.